<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>งานพัสดุและสินทรัพย์ - โรงเรียนมหาวชิราวุธ จังหวัดสงขลา</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Prompt:wght@300;400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  
  <style>
    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    
    html, body { 
      height: 100%; overflow-y: auto; overflow-x: hidden; -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch; 
    }
    body { 
      font-family: 'Prompt', sans-serif; 
      background-color: #f0f4f8; 
      color: #1e293b;
    }
    
    .main-container { 
      max-width: 1140px; 
      margin: 0 auto; 
      background-color: #ffffff;
      min-height: 100vh;
      box-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    /* ==========================================
       SECTION 1: HEADER
       ========================================== */
    .site-header {
      background: linear-gradient(-45deg, #002b5e, #1e3a8a, #004a9f, #1e293b);
      background-size: 300% 300%;
      animation: gradientMove 15s ease infinite; 
      padding: 35px 15px; 
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      text-align: center;
      color: #ffffff;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden; 
      border-bottom: 5px solid #fbbc04; 
      z-index: 10;
    }

    .site-header::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 0; left: -100%;
      width: 50%; height: 100%;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,255,255,0) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 100%);
      transform: skewX(-25deg);
      animation: shineSweep 15s infinite ease-in-out; 
      z-index: 1;
    }

    @keyframes gradientMove {
      0% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
      50% { background-position: 100% 50%; }
      100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
    }

    @keyframes shineSweep {
      0% { left: -100%; }
      40% { left: 200%; } 
      100% { left: 200%; } 
    }

    .header-content { z-index: 2; position: relative; }
    
    .site-header img.logo {
      width: 90px; 
      height: auto;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
      filter: drop-shadow(0 6px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.3));
    }

    .dept-title {
      font-size: 28px; 
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #fbbc04; 
      text-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(251, 188, 4, 0.4), 0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.6);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      word-break: keep-all; 
    }

    .school-subtitle-th {
      display: block; 
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: #ffffff;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      word-break: keep-all;
      margin-top: 5px;
    }

    .school-subtitle-en {
      display: block; 
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: #e2e8f0;
      letter-spacing: 0.5px;
      word-break: keep-all;
      margin-top: 3px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* ==========================================
       SECTION: เนื้อหาหลัก & BACKGROUND ORBS
       ========================================== */
    .content-wrapper { 
      padding: 30px 15px 60px 15px; 
      position: relative;
      z-index: 2;
    }

    .content-wrapper::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      top: 100px; left: -100px;
      width: 300px; height: 300px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(251,188,4,0.12) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      z-index: -1;
    }
    .content-wrapper::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      bottom: 100px; right: -100px;
      width: 350px; height: 350px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(0,43,94,0.08) 0%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 70%);
      border-radius: 50%;
      z-index: -1;
    }

    .section-title {
      background: rgba(0, 43, 94, 0.7); 
      backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
      color: #ffffff; 
      font-size: 18px; 
      font-weight: 600; 
      padding: 12px 20px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);
      border-left: 6px solid #fbbc04;
      margin-bottom: 20px; 
      margin-top: 15px;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);
      display: flex; 
      align-items: center;
      word-break: keep-all;
    }

    /* ==========================================
       GLASSMORPHISM MENU CARDS 
       ========================================== */
    .menu-grid {
      display: grid; 
      grid-template-columns: 1fr; 
      gap: 15px; 
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }
    
    .menu-card {
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); 
      backdrop-filter: blur(25px); 
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(25px);
      border: 0.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3); 
      border-radius: 20px; 
      padding: 24px;
      text-align: left; 
      text-decoration: none; 
      color: #1e293b;
      position: relative;
      min-height: 140px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      box-shadow: 0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03), inset 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
      transition: all 0.5s cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
    }
    
    .card-title { 
      font-size: 16px; 
      font-weight: 600; 
      line-height: 1.4; 
      color: #0f172a;
      word-break: keep-all;
    }
    
    .card-bottom {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-end;
      margin-top: 15px;
    }
    
    .icon-wrapper { 
      width: 42px; height: 42px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      backdrop-filter: blur(5px);
      border-radius: 12px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
      border: 0.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
    }
    .icon-svg { width: 22px; height: 22px; fill: #002b5e; transition: fill 0.3s; }
    
    .arrow-circle {
      width: 32px; height: 32px;
      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);
      border-radius: 50%;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      color: #64748b;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: bold;
      transition: all 0.3s;
    }

    .menu-card:hover { 
      background: rgba(0, 43, 94, 0.5); 
      border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }
    .menu-card:hover .card-title { color: #ffffff; }
    .menu-card:hover .icon-wrapper { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.1); }
    .menu-card:hover .icon-svg { fill: #fbbc04; }
    .menu-card:hover .arrow-circle { background: #fbbc04; color: #002b5e; transform: translateX(3px); }

    /* ==========================================
       FOOTER
       ========================================== */
    .footer-bar { 
      background: #1e293b; 
      padding: 25px 15px; text-align: center; 
      font-size: 13px; color: #e2e8f0; 
      word-break: keep-all; line-height: 1.6; border-top: 4px solid #0f172a;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 10;
    }

    /* ==========================================
       DESKTOP OPTIMIZATION (จอใหญ่)
       ========================================== */
    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      .site-header { padding: 60px 40px; }
      .site-header img.logo { width: 120px; margin-bottom: 20px; }
      .dept-title { font-size: 48px; margin-bottom: 12px; }
      .school-subtitle-th { font-size: 22px; }
      .school-subtitle-en { font-size: 14px; }
      
      .content-wrapper { padding: 50px; }
      .section-title { font-size: 22px; padding: 18px 30px; margin-bottom: 30px; }
      
      .menu-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 30px; max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto 50px auto; } 
      .menu-card { min-height: 200px; padding: 35px; border-radius: 24px; }
      .card-title { font-size: 20px; }
      .icon-wrapper { width: 56px; height: 56px; }
      .icon-svg { width: 30px; height: 30px; }
      
      .footer-bar { font-size: 14px; padding: 30px 20px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="main-container">
    
    <div class="site-header">
      <div class="header-content">
        <img src="https://www.mvsk.ac.th/images/logo.png" alt="MVSK LOGO" class="logo" onerror="this.src='https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/d/1PVf5EA7ntHrhJBLbwOuobqWfd9mvscY8'">
        <h1 class="dept-title">งานพัสดุและสินทรัพย์</h1>
        <span class="school-subtitle-th">โรงเรียนมหาวชิราวุธ จังหวัดสงขลา</span>
        <span class="school-subtitle-en">MAHAVAJIRAVUDH CHANGWATSONGKHLA SCHOOL</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="content-wrapper">
      
